    <string name="local_league_overview">Madrid in Game is the Madrid City Council\'s initiative to elevate amateur Esports talent through the creation of the Esports Series Madrid competitions. They consist of two seasons per year in which you can face the best players in a safe and optimal gaming environment.</string>
